WEBVTT

00:00:00.751 --> 00:00:08.001
Analytics shows where Congo has been. It only counts events that have already passed, and that Congo actually went to.

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:11.791
At the top, choose All years, or pick a single year.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:18.171
Scroll down for the totals, the events per year and per month, and the split per country and per type of event.

00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:25.381
The map shows every city where Congo played. Switch between Benelux, Europe, the whole world and the Americas.

